  "changes": {
    "759f74e2-e735-43cb-b86c-10adf022daf9": "Five real Mac checks passed: saving and reopening, preserving an unsent draft, full backup, recovering an unsaved edit, and applying/undoing the saved writing proposal. The session found a missing accessibility control for note rows; a small correction is being prepared.",
    "a37e5801-b0c8-4330-800f-13d98b10338a": "Last refreshed: **20 October 2026 at 17:38 Europe/Tallinn**. This is a saved progress summary, not live activity.",
    "b1cb6cd0-eed8-48c2-a82c-fd375c23ecd8": "- **Unsent drafts preserved:** [PR 184](https://github.com/ewq100/brn-rust/pull/184) is merged with all four required checks passing. Actual Mac testing now confirms that the first passage comment preserves the exact draft, including after closing and reopening the app.",
    "b641f9c4-8ed7-4084-af14-431a5e37ea35": "- **Writing proposal checked on the Mac:** the saved proposal changed only `cobalt boats` to `teal boats`. Apply saved the exact result; Undo restored the original wording as a new version. The unrelated note and unselected comment stayed unchanged. The original test workspace was preserved and no new AI generation was used.",
    "200708f1-65b3-4f66-8ae0-07720e77b011": "- **Clearer grouped review controls:** [PR 179](https://github.com/ewq100/brn-rust/pull/179) is merged with all four required checks passing. Its actual Mac check remains pending because the Mac locked before that scenario began.",
    "05adb36d-8363-4195-bd53-82b4e5f6734a": "1. Correct the missing note-row accessibility controls, then independently review and check the candidate before integration. This correction is in progress; it is not yet verified or merged.",
    "30420f5a-d95d-4521-87e6-d8fc7ee085ea": "2. When Mac access returns, finish the grouped-review check and later verify the corrected note rows on the matching app. Saving, recovery, backup and proposal Apply/Undo need no unchanged repeat.",
    "2e6d8ee0-067d-42fd-89dc-177f822a8f9c": "**Please unlock the Mac when convenient.** Computer control reported that the Mac was locked and automatic unlock was unavailable. Headless development continues. The saved-proposal test app remains open after verified Undo; it will be closed through normal controls when access returns. Full VoiceOver/IME usability, backup restore and owner acceptance remain separate from the five passing checks."
  },
