            "id": "759f74e2-e735-43cb-b86c-10adf022daf9",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "Five real Mac checks passed: saving and reopening, preserving an unsent draft, full backup, recovering an unsaved edit, and applying/undoing the saved writing proposal. The session found a missing accessibility control for note rows; a small correction is being prepared.",
            "hash": "987a539f635248586bf0c8273d60cfb0a945c28c80485359f71961a090059191",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "a37e5801-b0c8-4330-800f-13d98b10338a",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "Last refreshed: **20 October 2026 at 17:38 Europe/Tallinn**. This is a saved progress summary, not live activity.",
            "hash": "ac355843681c01bd8868e02202a13781a0cd3415b6ba5507f275ceaf56a18cc4",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "200708f1-65b3-4f66-8ae0-07720e77b011",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "- **Clearer grouped review controls:** [PR 179](https://github.com/ewq100/brn-rust/pull/179) is merged with all four required checks passing. Its actual Mac check remains pending because the Mac locked before that scenario began.",
            "hash": "3b7157f8b67118132aca7e7c1d457f418e979f447dd87287676e883bf74cf4c6",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "b641f9c4-8ed7-4084-af14-431a5e37ea35",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "- **Writing proposal checked on the Mac:** the saved proposal changed only `cobalt boats` to `teal boats`. Apply saved the exact result; Undo restored the original wording as a new version. The unrelated note and unselected comment stayed unchanged. The original test workspace was preserved and no new AI generation was used.",
            "hash": "104b681cfd23daac6efc5f3ed6bbcc6dc2b3a686efec7baf39d91636e1dca3de",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "b1cb6cd0-eed8-48c2-a82c-fd375c23ecd8",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "- **Unsent drafts preserved:** [PR 184](https://github.com/ewq100/brn-rust/pull/184) is merged with all four required checks passing. Actual Mac testing now confirms that the first passage comment preserves the exact draft, including after closing and reopening the app.",
            "hash": "205640c573121963f3f84034f13268b2e3f1cd9c47d9ba2ebc346592aae1c641",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "05adb36d-8363-4195-bd53-82b4e5f6734a",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "1. Correct the missing note-row accessibility controls, then independently review and check the candidate before integration. This correction is in progress; it is not yet verified or merged.",
            "hash": "dd8d87157bdc39640aa8f8a0fd061da45eeade3e260cbb529ba92eab5570f9cc",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "30420f5a-d95d-4521-87e6-d8fc7ee085ea",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "2. When Mac access returns, finish the grouped-review check and later verify the corrected note rows on the matching app. Saving, recovery, backup and proposal Apply/Undo need no unchanged repeat.",
            "hash": "5b6d101b683f4c1177152a2f6953370361b425dd3b4cd8f98380ebc8a751c5fd",
            "metadata": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "2e6d8ee0-067d-42fd-89dc-177f822a8f9c",
            "kind": "markdown",
            "markdown": "**Please unlock the Mac when convenient.** Computer control reported that the Mac was locked and automatic unlock was unavailable. Headless development continues. The saved-proposal test app remains open after verified Undo; it will be closed through normal controls when access returns. Full VoiceOver/IME usability, backup restore and owner acceptance remain separate from the five passing checks.",
            "hash": "ae8404fec7a84bb6f05e2fe2d80abdbc5b5835c0f93bd771da94d2263ef6e377",
            "metadata": {}
          }
